  {
    
    "name": "Section 6",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-573957390081197104 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/rootsyntax-demo/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=573943225950143536&sectionId=573957390081197104)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0DVi2XJJr_text","label":"gg0DVi2XJJr_text","default":"What Our Clients Are Saying"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOuQqzrTFO_text","label":"ggOuQqzrTFO_text","default":"<p>Our customer advocates are standing by 24/7 to support you via email.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-4B2rUAmP_text","label":"gg-4B2rUAmP_text","default":"<p>Great team, smooth process, supportive and on-time delivery.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkI8qE1MAs_text","label":"ggkI8qE1MAs_text","default":"<p>Audrey and her team did an amazing &nbsp;job. They were very easy to work with and to communicate with. &nbsp;They really listened to me when creating my website. My project was completed on time, and I was left with the tools and support I need to makesure my project runs smoothly in the future. Rootsyntax is worth the price.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggb5PWkGiNI_text","label":"ggb5PWkGiNI_text","default":"<p>- Kiryosity</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBN2DX9aVp_text","label":"ggBN2DX9aVp_text","default":"<p>Pleasant experience, responsive team, all upgrades delivered.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9_KwkiHMg_text","label":"gg9_KwkiHMg_text","default":"<p>RootSyntax Technologies was a pleasure to work with and help me to accomplish all that I wanted with my website! Audrey was qucik to reply to my questions and my website received all of the upgrades I had wanted.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg90wU02Izs_text","label":"gg90wU02Izs_text","default":"<p>- Sonoran Gold Honey</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqs-PMFmXN_text","label":"ggqs-PMFmXN_text","default":"<p>You're walking on a cloud!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_XBjbzpd-_text","label":"gg_XBjbzpd-_text","default":"<p>Awesome job. Will hire again. Great communications. It was delivered as promised. The best part was they did not require micromanaging. Just got on with the work and finished the project on time and budget.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOkMOswdD1_text","label":"ggOkMOswdD1_text","default":"<p>- Rare Aviation</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLIaxc4fkc_text","label":"ggLIaxc4fkc_text","default":"<p>Work well for my problem feet</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyFpTNYy_V_text","label":"ggyFpTNYy_V_text","default":"<p>We needed a quick addition to the homepage of our site which is running a highly customized template. RootSyntax was prompt, their services complete and at a good value. We will definitely contact in the future.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQrPGyPoL-_text","label":"ggQrPGyPoL-_text","default":"<p>- Table Wraps</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdEz11IsG8_text","label":"ggdEz11IsG8_text","default":"<p>Expert revamp delivered stunning, user-friendly Shopify store.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcHMiami19_text","label":"ggcHMiami19_text","default":"<p>We couldn’t be happier with the incredible work done by our Shopify partner who revamped our website! &nbsp;Their expertise, creativity, and attention to detail have completely transformed our online store into a modern, user-friendly, and visually stunning platform. From seamless navigation to sleek design elements, every aspect of the site reflects their deep understanding of e-commerce and our brand vision.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHLnHhtSCH_text","label":"ggHLnHhtSCH_text","default":"<p>- 3 Monkeys Publishing</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvyj7kQsGM_text","label":"ggvyj7kQsGM_text","default":"<p>Rootsyntax delivered helpful, loved website.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggVfz4fWxP_text","label":"gggVfz4fWxP_text","default":"<p>My experience in putting together a website was zero. &nbsp;Rootsyntax listened to my needs and delivered. &nbsp;I love my website! &nbsp;The instructional videos on how to make changes have been very helpful with a slight challenge on language barrier.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggShp3wthVA_text","label":"ggShp3wthVA_text","default":"<p>- Pine House</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoXzed3swj_text","label":"ggoXzed3swj_text","default":"<p>Great work, timely delivery, no micromanagement needed.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoeJvhZY4-_text","label":"ggoeJvhZY4-_text","default":"<p>Awesome job. Will hire again. Great communications. It was delivered as promised. The best part was they did not require micromanaging. Just got on with the work and finished the project on time and budget.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggC5Hgfd1xU_text","label":"ggC5Hgfd1xU_text","default":"<p>- Rare Aviation</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggO2vmUf6Cs_text","label":"ggO2vmUf6Cs_text","default":"<p>Quick, valuable service on customized homepage update.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg58Ap20l9x_text","label":"gg58Ap20l9x_text","default":"<p>We needed a quick addition to the homepage of our site which is running a highly customized template. RootSyntax was prompt, their services complete and at a good value. We will definitely contact in the future.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9kwx7ftdp_text","label":"gg9kwx7ftdp_text","default":"<p>- Table Wraps</p>"}],
